OL,3,AMore than 70,000 social and affordable
OL,4,Ahomes to be built across England as
OL,5,Apart of #39bn plan
OL,6,
OL,7,FMinisters have announced where more
OL,8,Fthan 70,000 social and affordable homes
OL,9,Fwill be built in England over the next
OL,10,F10 years as part of an initial
OL,11,Fallocation of almost #10bn, in a bid to
OL,12,Faddress the housing crisis.
OL,14,FFunding has been granted to Greater
OL,15,FManchester, the West Midlands, West
OL,16,FYorkshire, South Yorkshire, North East
OL,17,FEngland, and Liverpool, as well as #6bn
OL,18,Ffor London.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
